What is Ethereum?

Ethereum is a blockchain with a computer embedded in it. It is the foundation for building apps and organizations in a
deventralized, permissionless, censorship-resistant way.

In the Ethereum universe, there is a single, canonical computer (called the Ethereum Virtual MAchine, or EVM) whose state
everyone on the Ethereum network agress on. Everyone who participates in the Ethereum network (every Ethereum node)
keeps a copy of the state of this computer. Additinally, any participant can broadcast a request for this computer
to perform arbitrary computation
